WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:02.410
SPEAKER: Today we're
talking about coding

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.930
AI and security best practices.

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:07.960
I'm [INAUDIBLE],, and welcome
to This Week in Cloud,

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:11.890
where we serve you the
lowest latency news.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.200
It can be difficult to
disseminate best practices

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.090
to developers in
your organization.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:19.000
But this is critical if you
want to save valuable time

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.350
for your business.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:23.710
To improve this, we are excited
to introduce custom samples

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:27.130
in Cloud Code, our
family of IDE plug-ins

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:30.340
helping you easily distribute
your best practices directly

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:32.619
to your developers'
environments.

00:00:32.619 --> 00:00:34.660
Head over to the blog
to learn more about how

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:38.860
Cloud Code helps developers
increase their productivity.

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:40.690
To help organizations
confidently

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:42.620
move their sensitive
data to the Cloud,

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:45.610
Google Cloud works diligently
to earn and maintain

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.110
customer trust.

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:50.590
Control and transparency
are pillars of our approach

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:52.740
to offering a trusted Cloud.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:55.300
We're happy to announce that
Forrester Research has named

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.450
Google Cloud a leader in
unstructured data security

00:00:58.450 --> 00:00:59.380
platforms.

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:02.390
To learn more, check
out the blog posts.

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:04.310
Ransomware, a form
of malware that

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:07.250
encrypts a user's or
organization's most important

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:10.130
files or data, rendering
them unreadable,

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:13.910
isn't a novel threat in the
world of computer security.

00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:16.880
Our commitment to being
the most trusted cloud also

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:18.110
is an ongoing job.

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:20.270
So we've created a
post to share guidance

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:23.300
on how organizations can
increase the resilience

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:27.140
to ransomware, and how some of
our cloud products and services

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:28.280
can help.

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:31.130
At Google I/O, we announced
the general availability

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:34.190
of Vertex AI, a managed
ML platform that

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:37.880
requires about 80% fewer lines
of code to train a model,

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:40.520
and allows companies to
accelerate the deployment

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:44.000
and maintenance of their
artificial intelligence AI

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.410
models.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:48.320
Vertex AI is a single
platform with every tool

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:52.250
you'll need, allowing you to
manage your data, prototype,

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:55.940
experiment, deploy models,
interpret models, and monitor

00:01:55.940 --> 00:02:00.230
them in production without
requiring formal ML training.

00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:03.530
Check out the blog post for more
exciting news about Vertex AI

00:02:03.530 --> 00:02:05.990
and even more from I/O.

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:08.539
If you want to read more
about these announcements

00:02:08.539 --> 00:02:11.490
or see a full list,
check out the link.

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:14.880
Any thoughts or ideas, leave
us a comment or tweet us.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:17.440
We'll see you in the cloud.

